  unitName: Ultra Blade Aem
  unitId: 50155
  unitNumber: 475
  description: A swordsman who became a knight in order to follow in the steps of
    his hero. After La Veda fell, he chased after Will who had broke off on his own
    and was about to challenge the gods. After catching up to him Will rebuked him,
    to which Aem responded, "It is the hope of all the people to see Sir Will safely
    through battle with the gods." It is said that, as Will smiled cheerfully, Aem
    stood in front of him and continued to counter the gods' attacks.
  summonDesc: Your energy is so warm.<br>I swear to become your blade!<br>Allow me
    to fight alongside you!
  fusionDesc: Power, fill my blade!<br>Give me the power to <br>destroy my enemies!
  evoDesc: I've realized my faults.<br>Devotion doesn't mean <br>blindly following
    others!
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
